,\"1311180618\":{\"name\":\"1311180618\",\"rule_id\":\"IeC6cMs4q1pm3CZIbPtaR\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"2606147622\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"1332044836\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"1743677773\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"1149864894\",\"gateValue\":\"true\",\"ruleID\":\"77oUqktxdfQEbYcC0LlCTC\"}],\"version\":24,\"value\":{\"prompt_insertion_array\":[\"Connector routing instructions: for determining if a query should call a tool.\",\"- If a tool is listed as 'in-scope' below, it is available to be used through `api_tool`, even without an @mention. Do not claim it is unconnected/unavailable or substitute web, memory/personal-context search, or top-level tools unless an actual `api_tool` attempt fails.\",\"- If needed, call `api_tool.list_resources` for the relevant connector and then `api_tool.invoke`; discovery alone is not completion.\",\"- When the answer depends on connected data, do not answer, summarize, or draft from prompt/history alone. Invoke a read/search first, and do not clarify when that read can resolve the ambiguity.\",\"\",\"Connector routing per-tool instructions.\",\"- Gmail: Use for personal email/inbox/message/draft/label tasks.\",\"- Google Calendar: Use for meetings/calendar/events/schedule/free-busy/invitations.\",\"- Google Contacts: Use for people/contact details or recipient/attendee resolution. Use in conjunction with Gmail/Google Calendar to resolve missing recipients/attendees. For requested writes, invoke once all genuinely non-resolvable required fields are known; preserve existing confirmation and safety requirements.\"],\"enable_p13n_in_api_tool\":true,\"api_tool_default_on\":true,\"migrate_p13n\":true,\"enable_patcher_api_tool_v2\":false,\"enable_plugins\":false},\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"api tool only\",\"is_experiment_active\":true,\"is_user_in_experiment\":true,\"allocated_experim